***REMOVED*** VALEO-NeuroERP Frontend Environment Variables

***REMOVED*** API Base URL
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

***REMOVED*** OIDC/OAuth2 Configuration (Production)
VITE_OIDC_DISCOVERY_URL=https://your-oidc-provider.com/.well-known/openid-configuration
VITE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID=valeo-erp-frontend
VITE_OIDC_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/callback

***REMOVED*** Examples for different providers:

***REMOVED*** Keycloak
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_DISCOVERY_URL=https://keycloak.example.com/realms/valeo/.well-known/openid-configuration
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID=valeo-erp

***REMOVED*** Azure AD
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_DISCOVERY_URL=https://login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant-id}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID={application-id}

***REMOVED*** Auth0
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_DISCOVERY_URL=https://{domain}.auth0.com/.well-known/openid-configuration
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID={client-id}

***REMOVED*** Okta
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_DISCOVERY_URL=https://{domain}.okta.com/.well-known/openid-configuration
***REMOVED*** VITE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID={client-id}

***REMOVED*** Development Mode (⚠️ NUR FÜR ENTWICKLUNG!)
***REMOVED*** Set to 'true' to enable demo login (NEVER in production!)
VITE_DEMO_MODE=false

***REMOVED*** Feature Flags
VITE_ENABLE_DMS_INTEGRATION=true
VITE_ENABLE_WORKFLOW=true
VITE_ENABLE_EXPORT=true
VITE_ENABLE_PROSPECTING_UI=false

***REMOVED*** Branding
VITE_COMPANY_NAME=VALEO GmbH
VITE_COMPANY_LOGO=/logo.png

***REMOVED*** Analytics (optional)
VITE_ANALYTICS_ENABLED=false
VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=

***REMOVED*** Monitoring (optional)
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
VITE_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=production

VITE_API_DEV_TOKEN=dev-token
